note src/searchtrace/st_corpus.om: Pure seeded OM-2 M23 G1 search-trace corpus
note generator, strict verifier, task-set parser, hook API, and hook equivalence.
note Compose after st_holdout.om (reuses sh_dat/sh_all/sh_dig and sth_hex_nib).

